          "when": {
            "prologue.starterChosen": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "Bianca",
          "lines": [
            "Everyone has chosen a Pokémon!\n...So that's that!",
            "Hey, I know!\nLet's have a Pokémon battle!"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "Cheren",
          "lines": [
            "Honestly, Bianca...",
            "Even though they're still weak Pokémon,\nyou shouldn't have Pokémon battles\ninside a house."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "Bianca",
          "lines": [
            "Don't be a worrywart!\nThese little ones are weak, like you said.",
            "We have to let them battle so they'll get\nstronger. It's settled, {name}!\nGet ready for a Pokémon battle!"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "battle",
          "speaker": "Bianca",
          "variants": [
            {
              "when": {
                "prologue.starter": 0
              },
              "trainer": "bianca_oshawott"
            },
            {
              "when": {
                "prologue.starter": 1
              },
              "trainer": "bianca_snivy"
            },
            {
              "when": {
                "prologue.starter": 2
              },
              "trainer": "bianca_tepig"
            },
            {
              "trainer": "bianca_oshawott"
            }
          ],
          "resultFlag": "8010",
          "win": [
            "Wow...",
            "{name}, you're gonna be\nan awesome Trainer someday, I can tell!",
            "No doubt!"
          ],
          "lose": [
            "Wha...?",
            "I got so absorbed in having my Pokémon\nuse moves, I won before even realizing..."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "Cheren",
          "lines": [
            "Uh...\n...",
            "Bianca, would you take a look around?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "Bianca",
          "lines": [
            "Wh-whoa!\nWhat happened?!"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "Bianca",
          "lines": [
            "Wow! Pokémon are amaaaaazing!!\nSo little, but so strong!",
            "I'm so glad that I get to have a Pokémon!",
            "...Oh.\nUm, sorry about your room, {name}."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "Cheren",
          "lines": [
            "You...are completely hopeless.",
            "Here!\nI'll restore your Pokémon for you."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "",
          "lines": [
            "Cheren healed Bianca's Pokémon!"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heal"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "Cheren",
          "when": {
            "8010": 1
          },
          "lines": [
            "It's amazing that you won\nwithout your Pokémon's losing any\nenergy, which is called HP.",
            "But you used some of the moves'\nPower Points, or PP, though."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "",
          "when": {
            "8010": 0
          },
          "lines": [
            "{name}'s Pokémon needs\nto be fixed up, too."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "",
          "lines": [
            "Cheren healed {name}'s Pokémon!"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heal"
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "Bianca",
          "lines": [
            "Hey, Cheren!\nHow about you battle, too?",
            "With all you know, I'm sure you can\nbattle without turning the room into\na disaster area like I did!"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "Cheren",
          "lines": [
            "I believe you're right!",
            "It'll be no problem for me to keep\nthe room from getting any messier.",
            "Besides, it's not fair if you two are the\nonly ones who get to have fun battling!"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "Cheren",
          "lines": [
            "It's decided. You'll be my opponent...\nin our first Pokémon battle!",
            "Let's see what you can do, {name}!"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "battle",
          "speaker": "Cheren",
          "variants": [
            {
              "when": {
                "prologue.starter": 0
              },
              "trainer": "cheren_tepig"
